Subject: [PATCH] refactor(governance): portable DetectorConfig for
 namespace-authority engine

Parameterize Luthiers layout (repo_root, code_roots, non_code_hints,
authority_artifact_paths, authority_registry_path) behind DetectorConfig
with preserved defaults. Expose analyze_namespace_authority_drift() as the
vendorable Git-independent entrypoint. No adjudication, verdict, severity,
evidence, or advisory-exit changes. Adds config-injection equivalence tests.
